Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,THE END
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.54,0:02:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother, you sure seem like\Na mighty prosperous fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.74,0:02:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ain't got no cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about buying me a drink, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take anything with alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ethyl, methyl, cough syrup, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw off, you stupid drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be bringing your raking\Ncorpse in here ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't give you alcohol,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd be happy to give you a nice\Nhot lead bullet between the eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.06,0:02:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.56,0:02:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you too scared to talk now, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't show your ugly\Nface around here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those stupid idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Meryl, what are we\Ngoing to search for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A giant man, a red coat, blonde\Nhair, or a guy with a mohawk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see now, after that, what was next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it with rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll only\Nbelieve what I see for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a gunman out\Nthere that's so amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they put 60 billion double\Ndollars on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where we're going\Nto begin our search today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awfully vague, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you be more specific?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm saying is that\Nwe need to pay special
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attention to anyone\Nthat might be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this seems to be such\Na peaceful, quiet town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to always be alert, Milly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never know when Vash's stampede is\Ngoing to show up and then kaboom. Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.76,0:03:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the insurance girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you working?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. Working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.26,0:03:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, your company must\Nbe very proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.14,0:03:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mr. Vash, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, Meryl, he matches\Nthe description perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think he's Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, because he raised his\Nhand when I called his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only raised his hand\Nbecause you called out to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a natural response when\Nsomeone calls out to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, we're looking for a horrible\Nfiend with a price on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not an obnoxious idiot like that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I have a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, that really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talking to you, pal,\Nyou bump into someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you ain't got nothing\Nto say for yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hi, catch ya later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:04:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, my shoulder hurts because\Nyou slammed into me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about buying me a drink? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't expect any money here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want you to buy me a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're fouls, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't even know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mary! Give her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give her what he's doing to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...? Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just run through, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may want me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much capacity here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's disgusting. Just ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Mary, wait! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you just leave me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a little make-up kiss, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, bartender, bring me\Nthe best of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got money, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My boy here is the son of\Na millionaire. Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing but the finest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please just bring us the\Ncheapest in the house, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want nobody making\Ntrouble in here so mister you're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.18,0:06:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna have to let me hold\Nyour gun until you leave huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a strange
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gun it was given to me I think
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a pretty good gun no it\Nisn't yeah you're pretty sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must know guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's three inches off from only 10 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't kill any\Nmore family, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I propose a toast to new friends. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of all the greatest inventions\Nman created in our history,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.26,0:07:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,alcohol is its greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, my pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.16,0:07:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't really intending on\Nbuying you drinks, but since I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could you listen to my request?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frank Marlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I mean, Miss, he is famous, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's famous all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the hero of this here town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A long time ago, this town was\Nattacked by vicious bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Marlon, the gunsmith, went around town?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,handing out guns he made himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.38,0:07:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,teaching folks how to use\Nthem against the bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you know the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:08:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's your business with Frank Marlon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted him to fix\Nmy old heap, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just pawned it for booze, and\Nyou'd have to buy yourself a new gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really want to give your\Ngun a complete stranger, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll only have yourself to\Nblame if you get shot in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd have to be a damned idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.50,0:08:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing but a hopeless old fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's really no sheriff in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.06,0:08:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, that's right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dear, this is a very quiet town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing serious ever happens here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud to say that Warren\NCity is a safe place full of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:09:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy people, the worst it\Never gets or a few crazy drugs
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mayor, I don't mean to alarm you sir,\Nbut there is something very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tell you now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The legendary criminal here\Nin my town, that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assure you it's no laughing matter\NWell, if he's really that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it would be kind of fun to have\Nhim attack and spice things up around here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mayor, but I don't find this funny at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.14,0:09:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.05,0:09:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like we heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big armored truck's gonna be\Ncoming to that town's bank at noon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent, dear brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 4,000 yards to the next town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have no sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't ask for a better location.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard a rumor going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:10:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say Vash the Stampede\Nshowed up and he's real close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean Vash the\NHumanoid Typhoon? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will have the humanoid typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the stampede\Nattack the armored car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it now. This is perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what'd you do that for\Nwe're just enjoying a drink
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your selfish wits? G-Get\Nme back my gun, Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.87,0:10:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.54,0:10:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head just started to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you have an idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to my place and drink it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you two doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the insurance girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure look happy, Mr. Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having a heck of a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, what are the two\Nof you doing out so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here on night patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My partner is convinced that Vash the\NStampede is going to show up in town tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does not need to know why\Nwe're out so late, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Night patrol?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's really great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't these girls wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's to wonderful women!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People only drown themselves in alcohol
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when they have something\Nthey want to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just an escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still drinking brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think you're\Ngonna be in any shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna work tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only do charity work. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get paid, so it doesn't matter\Nwhether I'm coherent or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.59,0:12:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend, the world is full\Nof the weak and the suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always made it my business\Nto help out those in need. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then I found a way to help those\Nwho aren't suffering at y 'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say it's wrong to\Ndiscriminate, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You help someone, and\Nthen someone else suffers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is how this world works. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why I've decided to do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:13:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I do, nothing but drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you have equality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to see Frank Marlon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well give it up, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just ain't the man he was 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's just a damned\Ndrunk as a gunsmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.18,0:13:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was something of a genius,\Nbut then in one day his?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His whole life changed when his wife and\Nkid were killed in a bank robbery, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They happened to be in the\Nbank at the wrong time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.32,0:13:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just got caught in the crossfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.32,0:14:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to Frank, the real tragedy was he\Nhad made the guns that the robbers used.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, he had given\Nthem the guns personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.90,0:14:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash the Stampede is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's attacking the armored car!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be real smart to keep your\Ndistance because this gentleman
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here is none other than the\N60 billion double dollar man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash the stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.86,0:14:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The humanoid typhoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.94,0:14:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get him real mad, he may just\Ndecide to blow this down to smithereens?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, how pleasant?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, would be nice if all the\Ntownsfolk with this helpful...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uh, excuse me... uh, Mr. Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Meryl Stryfe and\NI'm here with my partner
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,representing the Bernardelli\NInsurance Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And well, we were sent here to\Nshut up and just load the bags!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I would have bought
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him a box of doughnuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get better!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the lead out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.97,0:15:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Countermeasure number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the place of a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.98,0:15:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.74,0:15:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number two then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send everybody into a\Nmad panic by shouting...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.76,0:15:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, what do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go with number three. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you just stand back here where it's safe,\Nlet them take the money and shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:15:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.78,0:16:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you\Nsticking your neck out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.78,0:16:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you just keep quiet,\Nyou just might stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There'll be a lot less\Ndamage around here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, do you see that little girl? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her mother promised to\Nbuy her something with her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,money that used to be in the\Nbank before this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.42,0:16:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.33,0:16:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I just made it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing worrying\Nabout other people's money?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what good's it gonna do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.36,0:16:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.33,0:16:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the situation is not equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.06,0:16:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing\Ntrying to play the hero cowboy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.90,0:16:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not as great as you might think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.45,0:17:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, gee,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a flat tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you won't be escaping in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.86,0:17:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what you're\Ngetting yourself into, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This gentleman here is the one and\Nonly infamous humanoid typhoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.40,0:17:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.24,0:17:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was under the impression\Nthat he was a lot more handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you implying that I\Nam not Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.16,0:18:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.06,0:18:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can use force if we have to. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.02,0:18:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there! Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This gun is an original\NFrank Marlin special,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and don't think I'll miss\Njust cause I'm a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to be afraid\Nof this Frank Marlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Russian piece of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You actually believe you'll\Nhit me with that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.61,0:18:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:18:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I just standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.50,0:18:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That this situation is not equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.90,0:19:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently you think that you have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A piece of parting advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should always save your aces for last.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.60,0:19:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Checkmate, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shooting from behind is just not my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, they really stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't even loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's actually dumber than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's to all the great\Nfolks to save the town!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandma, what'd you wait for? Fill her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, please fill her up,\Nmiss, if you wouldn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.20,0:20:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never understand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things turned out well after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.26,0:20:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no damage to the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chief will probably\Ngive us both promotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.36,0:20:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the bandit was a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't really him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we still haven't gotten our\Nchance to meet Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.74,0:20:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But someone matches his description.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I've got to find\Nthe can. Stick him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't exactly count on this\Nfor everyday use if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've changed the cylinder\Nto the hammer parts for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.82,0:21:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave it a full tune-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, heck, you don't need to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there is one thing I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do with that gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I intend to use it to create equality\Nand peace throughout the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.56,0:21:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well if you ever wear it out again\Nbring it back I'll fix it as good as new
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,great when I do I'll Bring the bourbon\Nnext time no thanks I've given up alcohol
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got better things to do instead\Nof drinking. What do you think they're?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,talking about shh you know what I just\Nrealized pal I never did forget your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, I'm, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.60,0:22:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drink too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.48,0:22:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.04,0:22:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just don't want to admit that\Nyou're worried about him, do you, Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, and I'm not following\Nhim for your information.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.94,0:22:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just happen to be\Ngoing the same direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.94,0:22:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bang! Bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.40,0:23:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.06,0:23:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.12,0:23:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has nothing to do with what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a smile that will be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be perfect for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.66,0:23:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.90,0:23:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.14,0:23:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Na,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.48,0:23:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,na, na, na, na,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.34,0:24:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,na, na, na.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.94,0:24:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A past that can't be\Nforgotten and can't be buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.36,0:24:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A past that can't even be\Nshaken for just a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.62,0:24:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sentiment deep inside each of\Ntheir hearts is strong and equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.54,0:24:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For beloved parents and\Nfor a beloved daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.80,0:24:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two men can only find the answer\Nfrom behind their triggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.46,0:24:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment the sentimental bullets flew\Ntowards each other, the men stood silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.22,0:24:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet were weeping, the past enslaved.

